"""
ReconLite v2 - Bug Bounty URL Classifier

A safe reconnaissance helper that reads URLs from tools like gau, katana, or waybackurls
and organizes them into useful bug bounty categories with priority scoring.

Input modes:
  reconlite -i urls.txt -o recon-output --domain example.com
  gau example.com | reconlite -o recon-output --domain example.com
  katana -u https://example.com -silent | reconlite -o recon-output

It does NOT exploit anything. It only classifies URLs for manual review.

Author: Chathura Chamantha
"""

